<section class="hot-chapter hot-wrap hot-narrow" id="questions"><p class="hot-eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Before you order for Thanksgiving</h2><div class="hot-faq" style="margin-top:20px"><details><summary>When should I order for Thanksgiving?</summary><p class="hot-a">Orders ship Tuesday or Wednesday and usually arrive Wednesday or Thursday, and delivery is not guaranteed for an exact day. For a Thursday, November 26 table, order the week before: an order placed before 8am PT on Monday, November 16 ships Tuesday the 17th.</p></details><details><summary>How do I thaw it in time?</summary><p class="hot-a">Overnight in the refrigerator in the sealed pack, about 12 hours, then pat it dry. In a hurry, submerge the sealed pack in a bowl of chilled water for 20 to 30 minutes, changing the water once. Never at room temperature, and never in warm water.</p></details><details><summary>How many people does it feed?</summary><p class="hot-a">It is on every product page. As a guide for this menu: a steelhead loin and a whole trout each serve two, a 16 oz bag of shrimp serves four, and branzino comes as two 6 oz fillets.</p></details></div><p style="margin-top:16px"><a href="/pages/holiday-seafood-guide#before">More answers in the holiday guide</a></p></section>
